.TH "borg-known-repos" "1" "2026-10-13" "" "borg backup tool"
.SH Name
borg-known-repos \- List repositories Borg has local state for (security info and/or cache).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.sp
borg [common options] known\-repos [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.sp
Lists the repositories this local Borg installation currently has state for \-
security info (key type, last known location), a local repository cache, and/or key
files \- without accessing any repository itself (\-r/\-\-repo has no effect). \(dqLayout\(dq
is which state was found in (not the on\-disk repository format, see \(dqborg repo\-info\(dq
for that) \- a security\-only repo gets \(dqunknown\(dq when $BORG_SECURITY_DIR makes the
borg2 and legacy security roots coincide; \(dqLast written\(dq is the cache config\(aqs mtime,
a best\-effort last\-used proxy, not an exact timestamp and not a staleness check on its
own; a mismatch between a legacy repo\(aqs known location and its cache\(aqs last location
is flagged; a key file\(aqs presence does not by itself mean the repository is still
openable. Use \-\-json for a machine\-readable version.
.SH OPTIONS
.sp
See \fIborg\-common(1)\fP for common options of Borg commands.
.SS options
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B  \-\-json
format output as JSON
.UNINDENT
.SH EXAMPLES
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
$ borg known\-repos
Repository ID                                                    Layout Cache Security           Key files Last written        Location
401606173d54eab22cd98de67278d093e3bae7b187da3af8c6430f18fa1112bb borg2  180 B aes256\-ocb, sha256 \-         2026\-10\-12T17:15:19 /path/to/repo

$ borg known\-repos \-\-json
{
    \(dqrepositories\(dq: [
        {
            \(dqcache_config_mtime\(dq: \(dq2026\-10\-12T17:15:19.785785+09:00\(dq,
            \(dqcache_size\(dq: 180,
            \(dqhas_cache\(dq: true,
            \(dqhas_security_info\(dq: true,
            \(dqid\(dq: \(dq401606173d54eab22cd98de67278d093e3bae7b187da3af8c6430f18fa1112bb\(dq,
            \(dqkey_file_count\(dq: 0,
            \(dqkey_type\(dq: \(dqaes256\-ocb, sha256\(dq,
            \(dqlayout\(dq: \(dqborg2\(dq,
            \(dqlocation\(dq: \(dq/path/to/repo\(dq,
            \(dqlocation_mismatch\(dq: false
        }
    ]
}
